{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>A great voice and it did not cease.</b> As its Targum renders: ולא פסק, 'and it did not cease.' As our Rabbis expounded: for all forty days that Moses stood on the mountain, the voices from the mountain did not cease. Another interpretation: He did not add His voice to speak to all Israel beyond the Ten Commandments — as in כי יסף מכאוב על מכאובי."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:51:49.396382279Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}